	(text_box "• Technology: 4-channel bidirectional ESD array with ~3.5 Ω series resistors (USON-10 flow-through)\n• Electrical Specs: V_RWM = ±3.6 V | V_BR ≥ ±5.0 V | I_leak = 10 nA max (no VCC/VBUS pin required)\n• Parasitic Capacitance: C_LINE = 0.5 pF typ / 0.6 pF max (preserves fast SPI SCK & I²C rise times)\n• System Clamping: V_CLAMP = +8 V / -5 V at MCU side under ±8 kV Contact ESD (IEC 61000-4-2 Level 4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95.25 60.96 0)
		(size 114.3 10.1599)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
